1
00:00:00,045 --> 00:00:05,045
-=THE LAST FANTASY=- 荣誉出品 本字幕仅供学习交流，严禁用于商业途径

2
00:00:06,045 --> 00:00:10,091
-=TLF字幕组=- 翻译：psjmz 校对：ch1plus1

3
00:00:45,045 --> 00:00:50,091
Attention, Mr. Hayes, your wife is waiting at the station.

4
00:00:50,551 --> 00:00:54,011
Oh, it was after-- You know, after last year's corporate...
自去年后进入公司后

5
00:00:54,221 --> 00:00:56,597
...my wife was always encouraging me, you know?
我的妻子就一直鼓励我

6
00:00:56,765 --> 00:01:00,184
She said, "No, you did fine in the corporate." I was a bit nervous.
她说，你干得很出色 我有些紧张

7
00:01:00,394 --> 00:01:02,437
This little guy. Hello? Sorry.
这小麦克风…哈罗，对不起

8
00:01:02,646 --> 00:01:03,813
-That's nice, eh? -Yeah.
-这样很好，是吗？ -是的

9
00:01:03,981 --> 00:01:05,606
Nice background with the people.
很好的背景，有人在那里

10
00:01:06,984 --> 00:01:09,902
-We are here at-- Must I look in there? -Look into the lens.
- 我们现在在...我必须这样看？ - 直视镜头即可

11
00:01:10,070 --> 00:01:13,906
We are here at MNU head office, Department of Alien Affairs.
我们现在在MNU（多国联）总部 外星人事务部

12
00:01:14,074 --> 00:01:16,159
My name is Wikus van de Merwe.
我是维库斯·范德默尔

13
00:01:16,326 --> 00:01:19,787
And behind me you can see other Alien Affairs workers.
在我身后，你可以看到 外星人事务部的其它工作人员

14
00:01:19,997 --> 00:01:22,915
And what we do here at this department is...
我们这个部门的工作是

15
00:01:23,083 --> 00:01:27,503
...we try to engage with the prawn on behalf of MNU...
试图与大虾沟通

16
00:01:27,671 --> 00:01:30,298
...and on behalf of humans.
为了MNU和人类的利益

17
00:01:31,925 --> 00:01:34,635
To everyone's surprise, the ship didn't come to a stop...
让所有人都感到意外的是 太空船并没有停在

18
00:01:34,803 --> 00:01:38,681
...over Manhattan or Washington or Chicago...
曼哈顿，华盛顿，抑或芝加哥

19
00:01:38,849 --> 00:01:44,061
...but instead coasted to a halt directly over the city of Johannesburg.
而是直接停在了约翰内斯堡上空

20
00:01:47,941 --> 00:01:50,443
The doors didn't open for months. Nobody could get in.
船门在三个月内都没有打开 它就悬浮在那里，没人能够进去

21
00:01:50,611 --> 00:01:54,363
They eventually decided, after much deliberation, that the best thing to do...
在深思熟虑之后，他们终于决定

22
00:01:54,531 --> 00:01:57,158
...would be to physically cut their way in.
最好的方法是切割飞船破门而入

23
00:02:01,246 --> 00:02:03,956
We're gonna need a drill down here.
我们得在这里钻个孔

24
00:02:04,541 --> 00:02:09,212
ye were on the verge of first contact.
我们即将进行第一次接触

25
00:02:09,421 --> 00:02:11,130
The whole world was watching.
整个世界的目光都聚集于此

26
00:02:11,298 --> 00:02:12,465
We need some more light.
我们需要更多的光线

27
00:02:14,259 --> 00:02:17,595
Expecting, I don't know, music from heaven and bright shining lights.
期待，还是别的，我也不清楚 或许是音乐伴着强光闪耀从天而降

28
00:02:17,805 --> 00:02:19,889
Got a lot of moisture in here.
发现有大量的水

29
00:02:20,808 --> 00:02:22,391
Yeah, just go slowly.
是吗，慢步向前

30
00:02:23,101 --> 00:02:25,561
Oh, my God.
哦，天呀

31
00:02:33,529 --> 00:02:36,280
The creatures were extremely malnourished.
这些生物非常营养不良

32
00:02:36,448 --> 00:02:39,826
They were very unhealthy. They seemed to be aimless.
他们非常不健康，看起来精神恍惚

33
00:02:40,035 --> 00:02:43,037
There was a lot of international pressure on us at the time.
当时我们顶着来自世界各地的压力

34
00:02:43,205 --> 00:02:45,081
The world was looking at Johannesburg...
整个世界都在盯着约翰内斯堡

35
00:02:45,249 --> 00:02:47,375
...so we had to do the right thing.
因此，我们必须把事情处理好

36
00:02:47,543 --> 00:02:49,794
The government then established an aid group...
随后政府成立了一个援救小组

37
00:02:49,962 --> 00:02:53,840
...that started to ferry the aliens to a temporary camp that was set up...
开始将这些外星人运送到船下方

38
00:02:54,049 --> 00:02:55,925
...just beneath the ship.
临时建立营地里

39
00:02:56,677 --> 00:02:58,803
ye didn't have a plan.
我们事先并没有明确的计划

40
00:02:58,971 --> 00:03:00,721
There was a million of them.
他们有数百万

41
00:03:01,348 --> 00:03:04,141
So, what was a temporary holding zone...
因此，临时的收容所很快就加上了围篱

42
00:03:04,309 --> 00:03:06,978
...soon became fenced, became militarized.
成为了隔离区并开始实施军事化管理

43
00:03:07,145 --> 00:03:09,438
And before we knew it, it was a slum.
而在我们知道之前，这是一个贫民窟

44
00:03:10,232 --> 00:03:13,276
Well, the truth is nobody really knew what this place was.
但事实是，没人真正知道 这究竟是什么地方

45
00:03:14,695 --> 00:03:16,904
There's a lot of secrets in District 9.
在第九区有很多不为人知的秘密

46
00:03:17,904 --> 00:03:19,904
片名：第九区

47
00:03:27,541 --> 00:03:30,543
At first, a lot of attention was given to giving the aliens...
起初，大家比较关注

48
00:03:30,711 --> 00:03:32,545
...proper status and protection.
如何给予外星人一个适当的身份和保护

49
00:03:33,380 --> 00:03:35,840
They're spending so much money to keep them here...
为了维持那些外星人生存 政府花费了大量的金钱

50
00:03:36,008 --> 00:03:40,177
...when they could be spending it on other things. But at least--
这些钱本该用在其它地方的，但至少

51
00:03:40,387 --> 00:03:43,264
At least they're keeping them separate from us.
但至少这把外星人和我们隔离开了

52
00:03:44,026 --> 00:03:45,824
（非人类勿进）

53
00:03:45,830 --> 00:03:47,493
（非人类勿在此地逗留）

54
00:03:47,394 --> 00:03:49,186
I wanna be realistic with everyone.
我希望每个人都应该实际点

55
00:03:50,564 --> 00:03:54,025
-The aliens will not be able to go home. -The aliens are here to stay.
-这些外星人不可能回到他们原来的星球了 -外星人会在这里长留下来

56
00:03:55,319 --> 00:03:57,945
There were literally thousands of theories as to why...
对于船无法操作这件事

57
00:03:58,113 --> 00:03:59,989
...the ship seemed inoperable.
人们众说纷纭

58
00:04:00,198 --> 00:04:03,784
And what was speculated was that a command module had detached itself...
其中有种推测是

59
00:04:03,952 --> 00:04:07,496
...from the main ship and then somehow mysteriously become lost.
指挥舱已经和主船分离了 然后，又莫名其妙地失踪了

60
00:04:07,706 --> 00:04:11,042
Did it fall by itself or was it programmed?
它是自己掉下来的还是按照预定程序掉落的？

61
00:04:12,127 --> 00:04:13,169
I don't know.
我也不知道

62
00:04:13,378 --> 00:04:15,880
Examination of the old video footage...
认真检查这些旧的影像镜头

63
00:04:16,048 --> 00:04:20,509
...shows very clearly that a piece falls from the ship.
可以清楚地发现有一小块东西 从船上掉落下来

64
00:04:24,973 --> 00:04:28,809
We looked everywhere. There's pieces falling off that vessel for months.
我们到处搜索它 几个月里有很多东西从主船上落下来

65
00:04:28,977 --> 00:04:31,020
More energy weapon caches found.
我们发现了很多藏匿的武器

66
00:04:31,188 --> 00:04:34,023
The special task force conducted raids in District 9....
特种部队突袭了第九区

67
00:04:34,191 --> 00:04:37,652
Where there's a weapon, there's crime. Tensions rose and rose.
有武器的地方就有犯罪 气氛变得越来越紧张

68
00:04:37,819 --> 00:04:41,238
People became more and more fed up, and eventually the rioting started.
人们变得越来越愤怒并最终引发了骚乱

69
00:04:41,448 --> 00:04:44,992
Residents in Tembisa rioted for the third consecutive night...
塔比萨的居民连续暴动了三个晚上

70
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:48,162
...in an attempt to remove all the aliens from their township.
目地是为了把外星人从他们的城区驱赶走

71
00:04:55,253 --> 00:04:57,588
I think they must fix that ship and they must go.
我认为他们一定要修好那艘船 他们必须离开

72
00:04:57,756 --> 00:05:00,216
A virus, a selective virus.
病毒，精心挑选一种病毒、

73
00:05:00,968 --> 00:05:02,051
Release it near the aliens.
把它释放到外星人附近

74
00:05:02,260 --> 00:05:05,346
They must just go. I don't know where, but they must just go!
他们必须滚蛋 不管滚哪，尽管滚开

75
00:05:05,555 --> 00:05:07,473
If they were from another country, we might understand...
如果他们是来自其它国家的话也就算了

76
00:05:07,641 --> 00:05:09,600
...but they are not even from this planet at all.
但他们甚至都不是地球上的

77
00:05:09,768 --> 00:05:12,269
The government have enforced a nationwide curfew.
政府已下令实施全国宵禁

78
00:05:12,479 --> 00:05:15,856
These aliens-- Prawns. --they take my wife away.
那些外星人，那些大虾 他们夺走了我的妻子

79
00:05:16,066 --> 00:05:17,942
The derogatory term "prawn" is used.
这个贬损的词“大虾”用来指那些外星人

80
00:05:18,110 --> 00:05:20,903
Obviously, it implies something that is a bottom feeder...
很明显，它暗指那些以食腐为生的

81
00:05:21,113 --> 00:05:23,656
...that scavenges the leftovers.
低等动物

82
00:05:25,075 --> 00:05:28,202
You can't say they don't look like that. They look like prawns.
我的意思是，你总不能说他们不像吧 他们看起来就像只虾

83
00:05:28,370 --> 00:05:31,414
Aliens made off with an undisclosed amount of cash.
外星人抢走了数额不明的现金

84
00:05:31,581 --> 00:05:33,040
One bystander was hurt.
一个围观者受伤了

85
00:05:33,250 --> 00:05:36,377
What for an alien might be seen as something recreational...
在外星人看来很娱乐的事情

86
00:05:36,545 --> 00:05:39,755
...setting fire to a truck, derailing a train...
比如放火点燃汽车，让火车出轨

87
00:05:39,923 --> 00:05:42,508
...is for us, obviously, an extremely destructive act.
对我们而言，这些可都是相当极端的破坏行为

88
00:05:44,803 --> 00:05:46,804
They can take the sneakers you are wearing off you.
他们会抢走你穿的运动鞋

89
00:05:46,972 --> 00:05:49,724
They check the brand and take them. They take whatever you have on you.
他们会抢走你身上的一切

90
00:05:49,891 --> 00:05:52,351
Your cell phone or anything.
你的手机或者其它任何东西

91
00:05:52,519 --> 00:05:53,769
After that, they kill you.
之后，他们会杀了你

92
00:05:55,272 --> 00:05:57,982
After 20 years, public pressure forced the government...
20年后的今天，来自公众的压力迫使政府

93
00:05:58,191 --> 00:06:01,193
...to ship the aliens out of Johannesburg.
将这些外星人运出约翰内斯堡

94
00:06:02,070 --> 00:06:05,072
They had had enough, and they wanted District 9 to be moved...
他们受够了，他们要把第九区搬走

95
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:07,491
...and more intensively policed and controlled.
并受到更多警力更强的控制

96
00:06:09,161 --> 00:06:11,829
To enforce eviction, the government turned to Multi-National United.
为了实施这个大型的驱逐行动 政府借助于MNU的力量

97
00:06:11,997 --> 00:06:13,873
Welcome all, and thank you for coming.
欢迎你们，谢谢你们的到来

98
00:06:14,041 --> 00:06:17,001
Please listen very closely to this briefing.
请仔细听这个简短的指示

99
00:06:17,169 --> 00:06:21,714
Today we start a very complex and delicate operation.
今天我们要开始一个非常复杂和棘手的任务

100
00:06:22,966 --> 00:06:26,802
This is the Iargest operation that MNU has ever undertaken...
这是MNU所执行过的最大的任务

101
00:06:26,970 --> 00:06:31,057
...and we believe that it is going to be undertaken successfully.
我们坚信这个任务一定会执行地非常成功

102
00:06:31,266 --> 00:06:34,226
It is to move 1.8 million prawns...
这次我们要将180万大虾

103
00:06:34,436 --> 00:06:39,982
...from their present home in District 9 to a safer and better location...
从他们现有的家第九区转移到 离约翰内斯堡200公里之外的

104
00:06:40,192 --> 00:06:43,736
...200 kilometers outside of Johannesburg city.
一个更好和更安全的场所

105
00:06:43,945 --> 00:06:46,614
ye've built a nice, new facility where the prawn can go.
我们在那里为他们建造了一个更舒适的新环境

106
00:06:46,782 --> 00:06:48,741
He can be comfortable. He can stay there.
大虾能够过得相对舒适 它们可以呆在那里

107
00:06:50,619 --> 00:06:53,829
The people of Johannesburg and of South Africa are going to live...
远离大虾的骚扰后，约翰内斯堡和南非的居民

108
00:06:53,997 --> 00:06:58,125
...happily and safely, knowing that that prawn is very far away.
就可以过上快乐又安全的生活

109
00:06:58,335 --> 00:07:04,173
UIO protocol dictates that we give the aliens 24-hours' notice...
UIO协议规定我们至少要在驱逐前24小时

110
00:07:04,341 --> 00:07:06,008
...of our right to evict.
给予外星人的驱逐通知

111
00:07:06,218 --> 00:07:09,136
Today, you will serve these notices...
今天，你们的任务就是宣布这一正式通知

112
00:07:09,346 --> 00:07:12,181
...getting the aliens to sign the I-27 form.
并让外星人们签订I-27协议

113
00:07:12,349 --> 00:07:16,602
The legality that MNU is using to evict the aliens is simply a whitewash.
MNU用来驱逐外星人的法律 实际上只是一个幌子

114
00:07:16,812 --> 00:07:22,066
So I'm going to appoint a field officer to take direct command.
我将任命一个现场指挥官来直接指挥这次任务

115
00:07:22,859 --> 00:07:24,401
Wikus van de Merwe.
维库斯·范德默尔

116
00:07:24,569 --> 00:07:27,446
Everybody always said that Wikus was not a very smart boy...
大家都认为维库斯不是一个非常机灵的孩子

117
00:07:27,614 --> 00:07:29,406
...but he was a wonderful son.
但他是一个很好的儿子

118
00:07:30,826 --> 00:07:32,868
That was my Wikus. Just--
那就是我的维库斯，正如…

119
00:07:35,163 --> 00:07:39,250
Yes. Like up on the big stage. Thank you, Piet. Mr. Smit.
感觉人生又向前迈了一大步 谢谢你，皮耶特·史密斯先生

120
00:07:39,417 --> 00:07:44,004
I had to put aside the fact that my daughter was married to yikus.
我得抛开我女儿嫁给维库斯这个事实

121
00:07:45,841 --> 00:07:47,800
That didn't factor in my decision.
这点并没有影响我是否提升他

122
00:07:47,968 --> 00:07:52,471
It's almost as big as my wedding day. You know, not as big.
这个升职几乎和我结婚的日子一样重大 嗯...当然还没有结婚那么重大

123
00:07:53,890 --> 00:07:55,558
Wikus was always making me things.
维库斯总给我亲手制作很多东西

124
00:07:55,725 --> 00:07:58,394
He said that way, they just mean so much more.
他说这这些东西都情深意长

125
00:07:58,562 --> 00:08:01,647
He left this papier-m芒ch茅 ball on the sofa one day...
有一次，他把这个纸碗放在了沙发上

126
00:08:01,815 --> 00:08:05,067
...and I didn't see it and I sat down and I--
而我并没有看到，坐下去了

127
00:08:05,235 --> 00:08:06,402
I kind of squished it.
差点把它坐扁了

128
00:08:06,570 --> 00:08:09,822
They took all his stuff away for the investigation...
他们把他的所有东西都带去调查了

129
00:08:09,990 --> 00:08:12,533
...and I made them bring it all back.
而我向他们把东西全都要回来了

130
00:08:13,952 --> 00:08:15,870
-Congratulations, man. -Oh, thanks, man.
-恭喜你，年轻人 -谢谢，先生

131
00:08:16,037 --> 00:08:18,455
-Okay, you're gonna go to P-7. -Wikus. Wikus.
-好，你去P7 -维库斯，维库斯

132
00:08:18,623 --> 00:08:22,334
Leslie. How's it going, man? There's the shake. P-9 for you.
莱斯利，事情怎样了？ 这么办吧，P9归你

133
00:08:22,502 --> 00:08:24,420
I'm not saying what he did was right.
我并不是说他做的都是对的

134
00:08:25,797 --> 00:08:27,423
He took the choices that were given.
他只能那样做了

135
00:08:27,591 --> 00:08:30,634
This is Trent. Fundiswa, Trent. Trent, Fundiswa.
这是特伦特，方德斯瓦，特伦特

136
00:08:30,802 --> 00:08:33,137
-Hi. -Fundiswa's the guy I've selected...
-你好 -方德斯瓦是我挑选来

137
00:08:33,305 --> 00:08:35,556
...to replace me. If he can make it today, eh?
替补我的人 今天他能行吗？

138
00:08:35,724 --> 00:08:37,349
-I'll make it. -You think you can?
-我行啦 -你认为你行？

139
00:08:37,517 --> 00:08:39,560
I just want everyone watching this...
我现在只想每个能看到这个的观众

140
00:08:40,937 --> 00:08:42,605
...to learn from what has happened.
都能从中学到一些东西

141
00:08:43,982 --> 00:08:47,234
You would think things like this happen to somebody else, not me.
你可能会认为这些事情只会发生在别人身上 而不会发生在自己身上

142
00:08:47,402 --> 00:08:49,570
Guys, don't forget to pack the stun grenades.
弟兄们，不要忘记了带好手榴弹

143
00:08:49,738 --> 00:08:52,448
Tovi. There's Tovi. How's it going, man? A long time, eh?
托维，这是托维 怎样，好久不见了？

144
00:08:52,616 --> 00:08:54,575
-You got my stuff? -Hey, big boss.
-有我的东西吧？ -嘿，头

145
00:08:54,743 --> 00:08:56,327
-How's it going? -I'm all right.
-最近怎样了？ -很好

146
00:08:56,494 --> 00:08:58,662
This is Fundiswa. He's training with us today.
好，好，这是方德斯瓦 他今天和我们一起训练

147
00:08:58,872 --> 00:09:01,916
I think I was-- "Disgusted" would be the word.
我认为“令人厌烦的”是个最好的词

148
00:09:03,335 --> 00:09:06,629
There was always a hint of something not kosher with van de Merwe.
我一直觉得范德默尔有点不太对劲

149
