00:17:19,247 --> 00:17:22,624
Just pop him out. There we go. And pop him out here.
你把这些东西拔出来 就这样，拔出来

296
00:17:22,792 --> 00:17:26,211
You can take that. Keep it as a souvenir for your first abortion.
你可以留下这个，留作这一次行动的纪念

297
00:17:26,421 --> 00:17:28,547
-You can feel like you did one. -Yes, boss.
-你可以想象你亲手干掉了一个 -是的，头

298
00:17:28,715 --> 00:17:30,215
Where's the team now?
队伍到哪了？

299
00:17:31,217 --> 00:17:33,844
Okay, here he comes, guys.
好了，他们来了，伙计们

300
00:17:34,011 --> 00:17:35,303
This is The Snake.
这是火焰发射器

301
00:17:36,055 --> 00:17:39,516
To go in and abort each egg one at a time would take a very long time.
进去一个蛋一个蛋灭会花上很长一段时间

302
00:17:39,684 --> 00:17:41,810
So this makes a lot of sense.
所以用这玩意才合理

303
00:17:42,562 --> 00:17:46,022
Do you hear that? That's a popping sound that you're hearing.
听到了吗？你们所听到的砰砰的声音

304
00:17:46,190 --> 00:17:50,944
It's almost like a popcorn. What the egg does is, it pops up.
听起来就像是爆米花

305
00:17:51,112 --> 00:17:54,156
The little guy, what's left of him, pops out there.
这些留在那里的小家伙就爆开了

306
00:17:54,365 --> 00:17:57,242
So that's the sound that you are hearing with the popping.
所以大家就听到了砰砰的响声

307
00:17:57,410 --> 00:18:00,954
You don't need that, man. Only sissies wear that. You don't need that.
哥们，不用戴那个，那是姐妹们戴的

308
00:18:01,164 --> 00:18:04,791
-You've been drinking a little bit, eh? -Watch the suit, man.
-喝多了吧？ -小心衣服，伙计们

309
00:18:05,001 --> 00:18:07,586
What are you doing with these television sets here?
你把电视机怎么了？

310
00:18:07,754 --> 00:18:08,962
What's this?
这是什么？

311
00:18:09,297 --> 00:18:11,423
Hey. Smile for the cameras there, eh?
嘿，对着镜头笑一个

312
00:18:11,591 --> 00:18:14,009
-That's a first-day find. -That's a big find.
-这真是首次发现 -是个大发现

313
00:18:14,218 --> 00:18:17,012
You see this? Look at this. Trent. Trent, look at this.
看到没？特伦特，看看这个

314
00:18:17,180 --> 00:18:18,722
There's weapons all over here.
到处都是武器

315
00:18:18,890 --> 00:18:21,391
TK-57572.
TK-57572

316
00:18:21,601 --> 00:18:28,148
Some of the guns are small. But if it shoot you, it make a big mess.
有些枪很小 但一旦被射中，也是威力无穷

317
00:18:32,695 --> 00:18:36,239
MNU is trying to move the aliens for humanitarian reasons...
MNU出于人道的目地要迁走外星人

318
00:18:36,449 --> 00:18:40,535
...but the real focus, just as it has been right from the beginning, is weapons.
但真正的目地，正如一开始所呈现的那样是武器

319
00:18:41,162 --> 00:18:45,707
MNU is the second-Iargest weapons manufacturer in the world.
MNU是世界上第二大武器制造商

320
00:18:45,917 --> 00:18:48,710
We assumed that we'd be able to pick up the alien gun...
我们曾以为我们拿起外星人的枪

321
00:18:48,878 --> 00:18:51,379
...and be able to shoot it. It didn't work like that.
就能够射击，但事实却非如此

322
00:18:51,589 --> 00:18:55,425
As we discovered, their technology is engineered in a biological manner...
因为，研究发现他们的技术实际上结合了生物技术

323
00:18:55,593 --> 00:18:57,677
...and interacts exclusively with their DNA.
要他们的DNA才能启动这些武器

324
00:18:57,887 --> 00:19:00,764
So it just doesn't work with humans. It's as simple as that.
人类就是无法使用，道理就是这样简单

325
00:19:02,809 --> 00:19:05,644
This is basically a guy and there's three humans here.
这画画的是一个大虾和三个人类

326
00:19:05,812 --> 00:19:07,979
Basically, trying to make a warning, you know?
应该是在警告我们，你看

327
00:19:08,147 --> 00:19:11,691
He's saying, "I killed three humans. Watch out for me."
似乎正在宣示：我一人就干掉了三，别惹我

328
00:19:11,901 --> 00:19:15,195
Hey, don't urinate on your own bloody-- Okay. Back up. Back up.
喂，别在自己的地盘上撒尿 退后，退后

329
00:19:15,363 --> 00:19:17,489
Back up, back up, back up. Guys. Thomas.
退后，退后，退后 伙计们，托马斯

330
00:19:17,698 --> 00:19:21,952
Control, this is Wikus requesting First Battalion air support, please.
总部，我是维库斯，请求空中第一营支援

331
00:19:23,287 --> 00:19:26,832
You want to talk to them or you want to talk to me? Yeah, you can talk--
你想和他们谈，还是想和我谈 是的，你可以…

332
00:19:26,999 --> 00:19:28,124
No, not them!
不，不是他们

333
00:19:30,670 --> 00:19:31,711
No.
不

334
00:19:34,882 --> 00:19:39,344
Okay, guys, thanks very much. Yeah, no, he had a spade.
好的，伙计们，太谢谢了 是的，我知道，他有把铲刀

335
00:19:55,862 --> 00:19:58,154
Look! I find some!
看，我找到这个了

336
00:19:58,322 --> 00:19:59,739
I tell you before...
我跟你说过了

337
00:19:59,907 --> 00:20:01,867
...this is human technology...
这是人类的东西

338
00:20:02,034 --> 00:20:03,410
...it is useless.
毫无用处

339
00:20:03,578 --> 00:20:06,037
Only our technology contains the fluid.
只有我们的东西里面才包含着流体

340
00:20:06,205 --> 00:20:07,914
That is not our technology?
这不是我们的东西？

341
00:20:08,249 --> 00:20:09,749
No, it's junk.
不是，这只是垃圾

342
00:20:10,543 --> 00:20:12,043
Keep looking.
继续找

343
00:20:14,797 --> 00:20:16,923
I find something.
我找到了这个东西

344
00:20:17,592 --> 00:20:21,219
Yes. This is what we need.
对了，这才是我们要的

345
00:20:21,429 --> 00:20:23,889
Good, little one.
做得很棒，小家伙

346
00:20:28,436 --> 00:20:29,477
Get down.
趴下

347
00:20:39,530 --> 00:20:41,489
Careful. Wait.
小心点，等会

348
00:20:42,450 --> 00:20:43,658
There.
倒在那边

349
00:20:44,827 --> 00:20:47,203
Why must it take so long?
为什么一定要那么长的时间？

350
00:20:47,371 --> 00:20:50,290
Because it is very difficult...
因为这相当困难...

351
00:20:51,500 --> 00:20:54,127
...so much can go wrong.
很多环节都可能出错

352
00:21:06,515 --> 00:21:08,725
Twenty years of work.
二十年的努力

353
00:21:08,893 --> 00:21:10,560
Our plan is ready now?
我们的计划是不是已经准备好了？

354
00:21:10,728 --> 00:21:12,896
Quiet. Listen.
别出声...听...

355
00:21:14,398 --> 00:21:16,483
They are coming.
...有人过来了

356
00:21:16,692 --> 00:21:20,862
To Control, van de Merwe unit. This is Yankee-Foxtrot-5-3-0.
范德默尔呼叫总部 这是杨基福斯特5-3-0

357
00:21:21,072 --> 00:21:24,032
This is a dangerous area, you know.
这个地段比较危险

358
00:21:24,200 --> 00:21:25,867
You must hide this...
你必须把这个藏起来

359
00:21:26,410 --> 00:21:28,411
...they must not find it.
绝不能让他们发现它

360
00:21:28,621 --> 00:21:30,997
Answer the door and be polite.
开门并礼貌点

361
00:21:31,457 --> 00:21:33,541
No! You take it.
不！你带上它

362
00:21:34,251 --> 00:21:38,546
Okay, now, you see, this is a problem. This is a gang sign. You see this?
你看，这就是问题的关键 这就是帮派的标志，看到没？

363
00:21:38,714 --> 00:21:41,549
So again, looks like we have a-- Thomas, look sharp, eh?
看起来我们找到了… 托马斯，警惕点

364
00:21:41,717 --> 00:21:43,468
Looks like we have more gang members.
看来帮派成员越来越多了

365
00:21:43,636 --> 00:21:46,179
Fundiswa, you just stay back. You stay behind Thomas.
方德斯瓦，你站在后面 站在托马斯后面

366
00:21:46,347 --> 00:21:47,597
This place is swarming with MNU.
这里到处是MNU的人

367
00:21:47,765 --> 00:21:48,807
Open up!
开门

368
00:21:48,975 --> 00:21:50,058
I will be searched.
我肯定会被发现的

369
00:21:50,351 --> 00:21:51,851
I must get back to my son.
我得回到我孩子身边

370
00:21:52,019 --> 00:21:53,853
Don't make them angry. Be polite!
别惹他们生气，礼貌点！

371
00:21:54,730 --> 00:21:58,274
MNU agents. Open the door, please. Hello.
MNU探员，请开门 请开门，喂

372
00:21:58,442 --> 00:21:59,526
Nobody is here.
这里没人

373
00:21:59,694 --> 00:22:02,404
We would like you to please sign-- That's unacceptable.
我们想要你签署… 这是不可接受的

374
00:22:02,571 --> 00:22:03,655
Move out! Move out!
出来！出来！

375
00:22:03,823 --> 00:22:06,658
-That is totally unacceptable! -Get out, you stupid prawn.
-那简直不可接受 -滚出来，你这只蠢虾

376
00:22:06,826 --> 00:22:09,411
-That's bloody rude. Get outside. -Come on. Move!
-那非常不礼貌，出去 -走，出来

377
00:22:09,578 --> 00:22:11,121
-Move! Move! -Get outside.
-走！走！ -出来

378
00:22:11,288 --> 00:22:12,956
We tried to talk nicely with you.
我已经对你相当礼貌了

379
00:22:13,124 --> 00:22:17,377
I tried to talk nicely with him, I did. Get him out to the front there, Thomas.
我对他已经尽量和气了 托马斯，把他押到前面

380
00:22:17,545 --> 00:22:19,295
-Keep moving. -Cheeky bastard.
-继续走 -你这无耻的混蛋

381
00:22:19,463 --> 00:22:21,006
You got something in your house?
你房子里有什么东西？

382
00:22:21,215 --> 00:22:22,966
-All the way, Thomas. -On your knees.
-托马斯，继续… -跪下

383
00:22:23,134 --> 00:22:26,219
-I'm gonna have a look. -Just stay there. Right there.
-我要进去检查一下 -呆在这，就这

384
00:22:26,387 --> 00:22:28,847
Sir, we have to serve you an eviction notice.
先生，我是来给你发放驱逐通知的

385
00:22:29,015 --> 00:22:30,265
Do you understand that?
知道那是什么意思么？

386
00:22:30,433 --> 00:22:31,266
No.
不知道

387
00:22:31,434 --> 00:22:34,394
This is a classic kind of gangster shack. I can tell you...
这是一个典型的帮派窝藏点 非常显然

388
00:22:34,562 --> 00:22:36,021
...we gonna find weapons here.
我们肯定能在这里发现武器

389
00:22:36,188 --> 00:22:38,773
Trent, watch your head. Don't hit the cow's head.
特伦特，小心你的头 别碰着牛肉

390
00:22:38,941 --> 00:22:40,984
Just checking for panels.
检查那些门板

391
00:22:41,152 --> 00:22:43,695
You hear that? Yeah, it's hollow there.
听到没？里面是空的

392
00:22:45,698 --> 00:22:47,949
See? Look at that. Look at that.
看，看那，看那

393
00:22:48,784 --> 00:22:50,577
I haven't seen this type of setup.
我还没看过这样的装置

394
00:22:50,745 --> 00:22:54,456
It's almost like a chemistry type of a set.
它看起来就像一套化学实验装备

395
00:22:55,332 --> 00:22:57,333
There's gonna be something.
这里一定有什么东西

396
00:22:59,378 --> 00:23:01,004
What is this kak?
这是什么玩意？

397
00:23:03,132 --> 00:23:04,758
What is this?
什么玩意？

398
00:23:09,263 --> 00:23:11,931
I don't know. This has got the markings there of--
我不确定，这里有一些标志

399
00:23:12,099 --> 00:23:14,267
So it's definitely alien.
但毫无疑问是外星人的东西

400
00:23:14,852 --> 00:23:18,229
But it's not a weapon.
不过不像是武器

401
00:23:18,439 --> 00:23:22,067
But I don't trust it. You know, I don't trust anything that--
但我信不过这个 不能相信外星人的任何事情

402
00:23:22,485 --> 00:23:24,194
Are you all right?
你没事吧？

403
00:23:24,361 --> 00:23:27,739
-Wikus, are you all right? -Cut it. Turn it off.
-维库斯，你没事吧？ -别录了，别录了

404
00:23:31,911 --> 00:23:34,079
Just switch it off. Turn it off. Turn it off.
关了它，请关了它 关了它

405
00:23:34,789 --> 00:23:37,707
You gonna just-- You gonna cut that part, Trent, out of this?
你会剪掉这段吧?

406
00:23:37,875 --> 00:23:39,250
-Yeah. -Where it sprays me.
-是的 -那段它朝我喷射的

407
00:23:39,418 --> 00:23:40,460
We'll cut that.
我们会把那段剪掉的

408
00:23:40,628 --> 00:23:44,297
We just found a dangerous object here.
我们刚在这里发现了一个危险的东西

409
00:23:44,465 --> 00:23:49,260
It has a fluid in it that I suspect might leak onto people or cause damage.
里面有液体，而且我怀疑沾到人身上会造成伤害

410
00:23:49,428 --> 00:23:52,889
So we just check that in and we take that down nicely to the lab.
所以我们把它装在里面，带回实验室

411
00:23:53,099 --> 00:23:54,974
It's not a weapon, but it's dangerous.
这不是武器，但是很危险

412
00:23:55,184 --> 00:23:56,851
He's got weapons somewhere here.
他在这里一定藏匿有武器

413
00:23:57,019 --> 00:24:00,063
My sense is telling me that. Let's check the other side here.
我的直觉告诉我这点 我们去检查另一边

414
00:24:00,272 --> 00:24:01,397
-Thomas. -Yes, sir?
-托马斯 -是的，先生

415
00:24:01,565 --> 00:24:03,525
-Thomas, keep the gun on him. -I got him.
-托马斯，枪继续对着他 -好的，收到

416
00:24:03,692 --> 00:24:06,319
Keep the gun on him, Thomas. There's weapons here.
枪继续对着他，托马斯 这里有武器

417
00:24:07,947 --> 00:24:11,241
This is Christmas. This is Christmas, my friends.
哦，重大发现！ 重大发现，朋友们

418
00:24:11,450 --> 00:24:13,701
This is the biggest find that I've ever seen.
这是迄今为止最大的发现

419
00:24:13,869 --> 00:24:16,121
Control, come in. This is Wikus van de Merwe...
总部，这是维库斯·范德默尔

420
00:24:16,288 --> 00:24:18,498
...requesting First Reaction Battalion...
请求第一营支援

421
00:24:18,666 --> 00:24:21,835
...at Foxtrot-Yankee-5-3-0.
福斯特杨基530

422
00:24:23,254 --> 00:24:26,005
-I'll send them out to you now, sir. -Stand by, guys.
-现在我马上派他们过去 -准备，伙计们

423
00:24:27,216 --> 00:24:30,593
This I've never seen. Have you seen this? Amazing. Look at this gun.
我从没见过这个，你见过么 太让人惊讶了，看看这枪

424
00:24:30,761 --> 00:24:33,012
-Fuck, man. -What gun is this?
-太屌了 -这是什么枪

425
00:24:33,180 --> 00:24:35,515
-This is absolutely amazing. -Just hold it still.
-这真是太令人惊讶了 -握紧了

426
00:24:35,683 --> 00:24:38,059
-What are you doing? -I wanna show this to Thomas.
-你在干嘛？ -我想把这个给托马斯看

427
00:24:38,227 --> 00:24:40,895
-You said we can't handle them. -I'm just gonna show it.
-你说过我们用不了它 -我只是想展示它

428
00:24:41,063 --> 00:24:44,524
I'm not gonna use it. It doesn't even work with humans.
我不打算用它，人类无法使用

429
00:24:44,817 --> 00:24:49,070
-Thomas, look at this gun. -Yeah. That's a big one, man.
-托马斯，看看这只枪 -是呀，真是个大家伙

430
00:24:49,238 --> 00:24:50,071
That's not mine.
那不是我的

431
00:24:50,239 --> 00:24:51,072
You're a dealer?
你是个军火商？

432
00:24:51,240 --> 00:24:52,198
No.
不是

433
00:24:54,285 --> 00:24:56,161
You hear this? You see what's happening?
你听到了？ 你看到发生的这一切了？

434
00:24:56,328 --> 00:24:58,830
First Battalion, my friend, you know what that means?
第一营，我的朋友 你们知道这意味着什么么？

435
00:24:58,998 --> 00:25:01,583
That means your days of faunting the law are over.
这意味着你逍遥法外的日子结束了

436
00:25:01,750 --> 00:25:05,086
Have a look there. You see that? What's that? That's a hiding for you.
看一看，你看到那了吗？ 那是什么？那是为你准备的

437
00:25:05,254 --> 00:25:06,671
That's a hiding.
那是为你准备的

438
00:25:06,839 --> 00:25:09,424
-Hey. Hey. -Stop that!
-嘿，嘿 -停下

439
00:25:09,592 --> 00:25:11,467
-Stand back! -Hey.
-退后 -嘿

440
00:25:18,434 --> 00:25:20,101
Wikus!
维库斯

441
00:25:34,283 --> 00:25:35,366
Come here.
过来

442
00:25:35,534 --> 00:25:37,994
-Wikus, are you all right? -Come here.
-维库斯！你没事吧？ -过来

443
00:25:38,204 --> 00:25:41,289
Where do you think you're going? Hey. Come on.
你想逃哪去？

444
00:25:41,457 --> 00:25:42,624
-Are you okay? -Fuck off!
-你没事吧？ -滚开！

445
00:25:42,791 --> 00:25:45,210
You don't run away from a chopper. Where are you going?
在刀枪面前，你跑不了 你以为你能跑到哪？

446
00:25:45,377 --> 00:25:46,836
No. No.
不，不

447
00:25:49,882 --> 00:25:52,217
Skeet off, brother. Skeet off.

448
00:25:56,931 --> 00:25:58,473
Koobus to base, come in.
库布斯呼叫基地

449
00:26:00,017 --> 00:26:01,684
I've got two people down.
我们有两个人受伤了

450
00:26:01,852 --> 00:26:04,229
MNU guard, MNU agent.
一名MNU警卫，一名MNU探员

451
00:26:05,439 --> 00:26:09,067
It's Foxtrot-Yankee-5-3-0, copy?
这是福斯特·杨基5-3-0，收到没？

452
00:26:09,276 --> 00:26:11,110
And we need a medevac ASAP.
我们需要医护队，尽快

453
00:26:11,278 --> 00:26:14,781
No, that's fine, Koobus. I don't need the medevac.
不用，没事，库布斯 我并不需要医护人员

454
00:26:14,949 --> 00:26:18,451
-Wikus, you burned your arm. -I'll just treat it here, Koobus.
-维库斯，你的手烧伤了 -我就在这里治疗就行了，库布斯

455
00:26:18,619 --> 00:26:21,079
It's not serious. I'll treat it here.
这不严重，我在这里治疗就行了

456
00:26:21,497 --> 00:26:23,581
I think you must go to a doctor, a hospital.
我认为你得到医院看看医生

457
00:26:23,749 --> 00:26:24,958
-No. -Get it checked out.
-不用 -去医院检查一下

